<title>USA: PHP Healthcare Q3 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>PHP Healthcare Q3 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>RESTON, Va. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months and Nine Months ended January 31, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					    Three Months  Nine Months</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenues			 $50,434 $52,886 $162,280 $147,934</p>
<p> Direct costs		    42,543  42,305  130,510  119,100</p>
<p>   Gross profit		   7,891  10,581   31,770   28,834</p>
<p>General and administrative expenses</p>
<p>					8,165   7,039   22,584   20,971</p>
